{"route":"/projects/retail-sales-foundations/","title":"Retail Sales Foundations Project | Data Learning Hub","description":"Use the shared retail dataset to define analytical questions, audit data quality, summarize performance and write defensible findings.","canonical":"https://datalearninghub.netlify.app/projects/retail-sales-foundations/","bodyAttrs":{"data-page":"project"},"mainHtml":"<main id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<section class=\"project-shell\"><div class=\"container\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"breadcrumbs\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><span>/</span><a href=\"/projects/\">Projects</a><span>/</span><span>Retail Sales Foundations</span></nav><header class=\"project-hero\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Available foundation project\" data-en=\"Available foundation project\">Available foundation project</span><h1 data-bn=\"রিটেইল সেলস ফাউন্ডেশন প্রজেক্ট\" data-en=\"Retail Sales Foundations Project\">Retail Sales Foundations Project</h1><p data-bn=\"Synthetic transaction dataset audit, defensible metric define, variation summarize এবং short decision-ready finding লিখুন।\" data-en=\"Audit a synthetic transaction dataset, define defensible metrics, summarize variation and write a short decision-ready finding.\">Audit a synthetic transaction dataset, define defensible metrics, summarize variation and write a short decision-ready finding.</p></div><span class=\"status-chip available\" data-bn=\"এখন available\" data-en=\"Available now\">Available now</span></header><div class=\"project-layout\"><article class=\"topic-main\"><section class=\"topic-card\"><span class=\"section-kicker\">01 · Download</span><h2 data-bn=\"Dataset ও dictionary নিন\" data-en=\"Get the dataset and dictionary\">Get the dataset and dictionary</h2><p data-bn=\"File synthetic; কোনো real customer বা company data নেই।\" data-en=\"The files are synthetic and contain no real customer or company data.\">The files are synthetic and contain no real customer or company data.</p><div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"button primary\" download=\"\" href=\"/assets/datasets/retail_sales.csv\">Download CSV</a><a class=\"button ghost\" download=\"\" href=\"/assets/datasets/retail_sales_dictionary.csv\">Download dictionary</a></div></section><section class=\"topic-card\"><span class=\"section-kicker\">02 · Frame</span><h2 data-bn=\"Analytical question define করুন\" data-en=\"Define the analytical question\">Define the analytical question</h2><ul class=\"objective-list\"><li data-bn=\"কোন region ও channel সবচেয়ে বেশি revenue ও profit তৈরি করে?\" data-en=\"Which regions and channels produce the most revenue and profit?\">Which regions and channels produce the most revenue and profit?</li><li data-bn=\"Daily sales কতটা variable?\" data-en=\"How variable are daily sales?\">How variable are daily sales?</li><li data-bn=\"কোন product further investigation প্রয়োজন?\" data-en=\"Which products deserve further investigation?\">Which products deserve further investigation?</li></ul></section><section class=\"topic-card\"><span class=\"section-kicker\">03 · Audit</span><h2 data-bn=\"Analysis-এর আগে data quality check করুন\" data-en=\"Check data quality before analysis\">Check data quality before analysis</h2><ol class=\"workflow-list\"><li><strong>Grain</strong><span data-bn=\"এক row একটি transaction line represent করে কিনা confirm করুন।\" data-en=\"Confirm that one row represents one transaction line.\">Confirm that one row represents one transaction line.</span></li><li><strong>Types</strong><span data-bn=\"Date, category, integer quantity ও numeric amount check করুন।\" data-en=\"Check dates, categories, integer quantities and numeric amounts.\">Check dates, categories, integer quantities and numeric amounts.</span></li><li><strong>Reconciliation</strong><span data-bn=\"Profit = revenue − cost verify করুন।\" data-en=\"Verify profit equals revenue minus cost.\">Verify profit equals revenue minus cost.</span></li><li><strong>Duplicates</strong><span data-bn=\"Transaction ID unique কিনা confirm করুন।\" data-en=\"Confirm transaction IDs are unique.\">Confirm transaction IDs are unique.</span></li></ol></section><section class=\"topic-card\"><span class=\"section-kicker\">04 · Analyze</span><h2 data-bn=\"Minimum evidence set তৈরি করুন\" data-en=\"Produce a minimum evidence set\">Produce a minimum evidence set</h2><ul class=\"objective-list\"><li data-bn=\"Total revenue, cost ও profit\" data-en=\"Total revenue, cost and profit\">Total revenue, cost and profit</li><li data-bn=\"Average ও median transaction revenue\" data-en=\"Average and median transaction revenue\">Average and median transaction revenue</li><li data-bn=\"Region, channel ও product অনুযায়ী revenue ও profit\" data-en=\"Revenue and profit by region, channel and product\">Revenue and profit by region, channel and product</li><li data-bn=\"Transaction revenue-এর histogram বা box plot\" data-en=\"A histogram or box plot of transaction revenue\">A histogram or box plot of transaction revenue</li></ul><div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"button ghost\" href=\"/tools/summary-statistics/\">Summary lab</a><a class=\"button ghost\" href=\"/tools/histogram/\">Histogram lab</a><a class=\"button ghost\" href=\"/tools/box-plot/\">Box plot lab</a></div></section><section class=\"topic-card\"><span class=\"section-kicker\">05 · Communicate</span><h2 data-bn=\"Final finding লিখুন\" data-en=\"Write the final finding\">Write the final finding</h2><p data-bn=\"তিনটি short section লিখুন: কী ঘটেছে, কোন evidence সমর্থন করে এবং কোন limitation বা next check বাকি। Observational dataset থেকে product বা channel performance difference cause করেছে—এমন claim করবেন না।\" data-en=\"Write three short sections: what happened, what evidence supports it, and what limitation or next check remains. Do not claim that a product or channel caused performance differences from this observational dataset alone.\">Write three short sections: what happened, what evidence supports it, and what limitation or next check remains. Do not claim that a product or channel caused performance differences from this observational dataset alone.</p></section></article><aside class=\"topic-aside\"><div class=\"aside-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Deliverable\" data-en=\"Deliverables\">Deliverables</h3><ul><li>Data-quality checklist</li><li>Metric table</li><li>Two useful charts</li><li>Three-paragraph finding</li><li>One limitation</li></ul></div><div class=\"aside-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Future reuse\" data-en=\"Future reuse\">Future reuse</h3><p data-bn=\"একই dataset Excel, SQL, Power BI ও Python project-এ আবার ব্যবহার হবে।\" data-en=\"This same dataset will return in Excel, SQL, Power BI and Python projects.\">This same dataset will return in Excel, SQL, Power BI and Python projects.</p></div></aside></div></div></section>\n</main>","scripts":[],"inlineScripts":[]}